    "detailed_description": "<strong>Every level is a single screen featuring various 2D platforming challenges. Spend part of your time limit to modify the level. Remove hazards. Introduce platforms. Decide your route through each level.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tight 2D Platforming</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606560/extras/0c32c1c4ce338bea67867c70a5b9cca7.poster.avif?t=1739998217\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606560/extras/0c32c1c4ce338bea67867c70a5b9cca7.webm?t=1739998217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606560/extras/0c32c1c4ce338bea67867c70a5b9cca7.mp4?t=1739998217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Run, jump and double jump your way through various platforming challenges.<br></li><li>Each level has a strict time limit that you must be swift to beat.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beat A Level Your Way</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606560/extras/3902be40359fc6d3c3b3d576a9c6aeae.poster.avif?t=1739998217\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606560/extras/3902be40359fc6d3c3b3d576a9c6aeae.webm?t=1739998217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606560/extras/3902be40359fc6d3c3b3d576a9c6aeae.mp4?t=1739998217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sacrifice some of your precious time limit to modify parts of a level.<br></li><li>Every level fits within a single screen. So you can completely plan your route before you start.<br></li><li>Choose exactly where to spend your time, allowing for a dynamic difficulty setting.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Objects Across Distinct Worlds</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606560/extras/4782f5c6a7afb4df6c41ab45ac35339e.poster.avif?t=1739998217\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606560/extras/4782f5c6a7afb4df6c41ab45ac35339e.gif?t=1739998217\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each of the 4 worlds has a unique mechanical identity to differentiate it from the others.<br></li><li>Spending time can be used to dampen harmful objects or bring about beneficial ones too!</li></ul>",
